<h2>Security Verification</h2>
<p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
<p>To finalize your secure login and maintain the integrity of our placement records, please enter the following verification code:</p>
<div style="text-align: center;">
  <span class="otp-code"><%= otp %></span>
</div>
<p style="text-align: center; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 32px;">
  This code will expire in 10 minutes.
</p>
<div style="background: #fffbeb; border: 1px solid #fde68a; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;">
  <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #92400e;">
    Notice: If you did not attempt this login, please contact support immediately or change your password.
  </p>
</div>
